# Untrusted folder: accept the trust dialog (internal/tui/dialog_trust.go).
# "2" jumps the cursor straight to "Yes, I trust this folder" and answers.
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@smoke
@size 120x40
@untrusted

WAITFOR /Accessing workspace/ 20
SHOT trust-dialog
EXPECT /Quick safety check/
EXPECT /kiln will be able to read, edit, and execute files here\./
EXPECT /No, exit/
EXPECT /Yes, I trust this folder/
EXPECT /Enter to confirm . Esc to cancel/
KEY 2
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT trust-accepted
EXPECT_NOT /Accessing workspace/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
